- cursors.md: the following feed via viewer.
- account-controls.md, deletion.md, follows.md, profiles.md: settings opt-out, browser outbox, public export.
- README.md quickstart.

.env.example and config/atmusic.env.example are replaced by pointers to worker/.dev.vars.example.

scripts/acceptance/workers-backend.sh runs:
- `bash scripts/check-ts.sh`;
- the acceptance project;
- check-bundle;
- `validate_case_map.py --check-tests`;
- `check_goldens.sh`.

It prints per-case records (target, command, count, result, commit, Worker bundle hash) and exits nonzero on any failure. Missing live gates are reported as blocked.

Finalise docs/verification/ts-case-map.json, taking ownership from W0-02, so every case maps to an existing test or a retirement.

Update VALIDATION.md and MILESTONE_STATUS.md with the executed evidence, and report passed, failed, skipped and blocked separately.
